V2.1.4-beta (2026-11-05)
Two new checks for descriptions with a structure. Item 4(b): the proton next to a CH3 doublet must show at least a
quartet for that coupling ("d" or "dd" with the CH3 constant is impossible). Item 6(a): CH2-CH2 of an open chain
in first-order notation is reported as the subcategory "formally non-first-order, flexible chain" (protocol v1.2),
not as an inconsistency. Conclusions unchanged on 5,120 development descriptions with structures except 3 new
item-4(b) findings (all real errors).
A beta until its accuracy is measured on the test articles of the second data set (OSF Update 3).
Not the version used in the paper (frozen 17.10c / v1.1, see CHANGELOG.md).
